abstract: "A local-first desktop interface for locally managed language models and repository-grounded exploration of scientific dynamical-model repositories. Ask the Model v0.8.0 adds the source-qualified BNR BLS C01 quarterly chart route alongside GISTEMP v1 and Energy Institute TES v2, with pinned-source provenance and History reconstruction. The bounded profile preserves the authorized missing 2025-Q2 observation without inventing a physical row or numeric value; generic arbitrary-source, multi-series and derived charting remain outside scope."
keywords:
